                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.30/219: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-11-26T16:00:00-05:00">November 26, 1930—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>91. Your 155, November 25, noon. January 31 acceptable as date for termination of
                    mission’s services.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
